\v 69 They¦218045 each donated to the treasury¦218046 according to \add ≈their¦218044 individual resources\add*—\add a total of\add* sixty-one thousand gold¦218048 coins, five¦218057 thousand silver¦218055 bars, and a hundred¦218061 sets of clothing for the priests¦218060.
