\p
\v 27 Blessed¦220271 be¦220271 Yahweh, the god¦220273 of our¦220274 fathers¦220274 who¦220275 put¦220276 it into the king's¦220279 heart¦220278 to¦220280 honour¦220280 Yahweh's¦220272 house¦220283 in¦220278 Yerushalem¦220286,
\v 28 and showed me his loyal¦220291 commitment in¦220292 \add ≈dealing with\add* the king and his counsellors¦220294, and all¦220295 the powerful¦220299 officials¦220297 of¦220297 the king. And¦220300 as for me, Yahweh¦220304 my¦220305 god¦220305 \add ≈blessed me with\add* \add initiative and\add* \add ≈the strength¦220301 to carry it out as\add* I¦220301 gathered¦220307 some Israeli \add ≈leaders¦220309\add* to go¦220310 \add ≈to Yerushalem\add* with me.
